{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7ER8vXDzVFf2EPWYPsv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before I draft, a few questions. Your answers will change what the update says.\n\n1. **What's the plan for runway?** $480k at $44k a month is about 11 months. Are you raising, cutting costs, aiming for breakeven, or still deciding? Investors will work out that number themselves, so the update should say what you're doing about it.\n2. **What do you want from them?** For example, introductions to clinic chains or to EHR vendors who might resell the reminder feature, or a conversation about bridge funding. If nothing, say so and I'll leave the ask out.\n3. **What signs do you have that the standalone reminder feature will sell?** For example: clinics that already asked for it, a waitlist, pilots, or how many clinics use an EHR scheduler and could buy reminders without switching. Also, why $150?\n4. **How do you want to handle the two missed updates?** Should it be a one-line acknowledgment, or is there a reason you want to give?\n5. **Can I name the chain that left?** Also, what was MRR at your last update, six months ago? That would show whether the flat quarter is part of a longer trend.\n\nIf you don't know some of these, tell me and I'll write the update without them."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":255,"cache_read_input_tokens":9518,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":255},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"60a72e28-2fa1-4ece-b71d-556634d9842b","uuid":"6e84a996-0712-4183-acd0-d64104909020","timestamp":"2026-11-16T20:23:59.657Z","request_id":"req_011Ch7ER8m6X623yssRXBjrH"}
